1
00:00:01,460 --> 00:00:02,720
大才女驾到
Here she is!

2
00:00:05,460 --> 00:00:06,777
感谢你们出席我的毕业礼
Thanks for being there, you guys.

3
00:00:06,777 --> 00:00:08,320
我们怎么会错过呢 亲爱的
We wouldn't have missed it, sweetie.

4
00:00:08,320 --> 00:00:09,540
你的演讲真精彩
Your speech was fantastic.

5
00:00:09,740 --> 00:00:10,596
你的声音出了什么问题
What's wrong with your speech?

6
00:00:10,596 --> 00:00:12,511
有那么明显吗 我...
Oh, is it that obvious? I...

7
00:00:13,280 --> 00:00:14,400
我戴了成人牙套
I got adult braces!

8
00:00:15,860 --> 00:00:16,420
你确定吗
Are you sure?

9
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:18,620
看起来好像不合你的尺寸
'cause they don't seem like they fit right.

10
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:20,498
我觉得你这么做很勇敢
I think it's a bold step,

11
00:00:20,498 --> 00:00:22,940
我支持你为自我提升而做出的努力
And I support you in your journey of self-improvement.

12
00:00:22,940 --> 00:00:24,820
不行 你不能把头发拉直
No, you're not getting your hair straightened.

13
00:00:24,980 --> 00:00:27,440
你爸爸真的很希望他能到场
You know your dad wishes he could be here.

14
00:00:27,620 --> 00:00:29,200
你在说什么
What are you talking about?

15
00:00:29,200 --> 00:00:30,900
我就在这呢
I'm right here!

16
00:00:31,760 --> 00:00:33,580
我让安迪帮我连上线了
I had Andy set me up

17
00:00:33,580 --> 00:00:35,180
这样我就能和你们一同庆祝
so I could be here with you all.

18
00:00:35,300 --> 00:00:36,420
我只是负责把电源接上
I just had to plug him in.

19
00:00:36,680 --> 00:00:38,540
当年我在医院不得不拔了我父亲的呼吸机
It was a nice reversal from when I had to pull the plug

20
00:00:38,540 --> 00:00:39,680
现在能做相反的事感觉挺好
on my dad in the hospital.

21
00:00:42,160 --> 00:00:43,440
菲尔出差时
While he was away on a business trip,

22
00:00:43,680 --> 00:00:45,004
患了严重的耳部感染
Phil got a terrible ear infection,

23
00:00:45,004 --> 00:00:45,900
医生说如果他坐飞机
and the doctors said he

24
00:00:45,900 --> 00:00:47,340
可能会造成耳膜破裂
could burst an eardrum if he flew.

25
00:00:47,760 --> 00:00:50,100
错过艾丽克斯的毕业典礼让我好难受
I was devastated to miss Alex's graduation,

26
00:00:50,100 --> 00:00:52,420
但后来我意识到我不需要错过
until I realized I didn't have to.

27
00:00:52,880 --> 00:00:55,100
我把手机举了两个小时
I got to hold up my phone for two hours

28
00:00:55,100 --> 00:00:57,120
就为了给菲尔直播毕业礼
so Phil could see the graduation live.

29
00:00:57,120 --> 00:00:59,400
我敢说我是那里唯一一个没穿裤子的父亲
Bet I was the only dad there not wearing pants.

30
00:01:01,020 --> 00:01:02,541
这玩意儿太棒了有没有
How great is this thing, huh?

31
00:01:02,541 --> 00:01:03,798
非常方便
It's so convenient.

32
00:01:04,120 --> 00:01:06,800
感觉如同我就在现场陪你们呢
It's like I'm right there in the room...with you guys.

33
00:01:07,260 --> 00:01:07,540
有人吗
Hello?

34
00:01:08,900 --> 00:01:09,300
人呢
Hello?

35
00:01:23,020 --> 00:01:25,240
歌洛莉亚 你可以告诉你的表亲
Gloria, would you tell your cousin

36
00:01:25,240 --> 00:01:26,720
不要再到处乱扔垃圾了吗
to stop leaving his trash everywhere?

37
00:01:26,960 --> 00:01:28,880
他这么胡闹有五天了
It's been five days of this nonsense.

38
00:01:29,120 --> 00:01:31,280
到我家来 吃光我的食物
He comes in here, eats all my food,

39
00:01:31,340 --> 00:01:32,280
喝光我的酒
drinks all my booze,

40
00:01:32,360 --> 00:01:34,051
连个碗都不知道洗
and never so much as does a dish.

41
00:01:34,051 --> 00:01:35,280
是的 和那边
Oh, yes, so different

42
00:01:35,280 --> 00:01:37,420
那些白人在做的事完全不同呢
from what all those white people over there are doing.

43
00:01:37,540 --> 00:01:39,020
你对你家这些好吃懒做的蠢货
You got a blind spot for the deadbeat

44
00:01:39,020 --> 00:01:39,980
容忍度还真高
yahoos in your family.

45
00:01:40,080 --> 00:01:42,640
他才不是蠢货 不要当着他的面这么说
He's not a yahoo, and don't say that in front of him!

46
00:01:43,380 --> 00:01:44,360
他不会说英语
He doesn't speak english!

47
00:01:44,520 --> 00:01:45,880
他能听懂
He understands it.

48
00:01:45,960 --> 00:01:46,520
真的吗
Oh, really?

49
00:01:47,380 --> 00:01:49,000
着火了 快跑 着火了
Fire! Run! Fire!

50
00:01:49,960 --> 00:01:52,280
你瞎说什么呢 贝丝 别走
You're being ridiculous, Beth. Don't go.

51
00:01:52,280 --> 00:01:55,000
你真贴心 但我不想打扰你们
Oh, you're so sweet, but I don't want to intrude,

52
00:01:55,080 --> 00:01:56,100
所以我们晚点再见吧
so I'll just see you guys later.

53
00:01:56,320 --> 00:01:58,060
歌洛莉亚 告诉她她可以留下
Oh, Gloria, tell her she can stay.

54
00:01:58,200 --> 00:01:59,320
你当然可以留下了
Of course you can stay.

55
00:01:59,360 --> 00:02:02,120
我们喜欢你来做客 尤其是乔
We love having you here, especially Joe.

56
00:02:02,480 --> 00:02:03,760
你是他的新宠
You're his new favorite.

57
00:02:04,280 --> 00:02:05,480
我曾经是他的最爱
I used to be his favorite

58
00:02:05,480 --> 00:02:07,260
后来我告诉了他 我陪他玩是拿了钱的
until I told him I get paid to hang with him.

59
00:02:07,940 --> 00:02:09,480
我只是觉得他有知情权
I just felt like he had a right to know.

60
00:02:10,260 --> 00:02:12,620
说实话 我之前以为自己喜欢上安迪了
If I'm being honest, I thought I was into Andy.

61
00:02:13,000 --> 00:02:15,080
后来他的女友贝丝过来看他
Then his girlfriend, Beth, came into town,

62
00:02:15,080 --> 00:02:17,900
她人很好 他们在一起很幸福
and she's really sweet and they're great together.

63
00:02:17,940 --> 00:02:19,680
所以本着毕业季的精神
So, in the spirit of graduation,

64
00:02:19,680 --> 00:02:21,760
我要正式放下他走向未来了
I'm officially moving on.

65
00:02:21,917 --> 00:02:23,620
而且和我自己的毕业季不同
And, unlike my actually graduation,

66
00:02:23,620 --> 00:02:25,420
这次没有怀孕惊吓
there's no pregnancy scare.

67
00:02:26,040 --> 00:02:26,820
好的
All right.

68
00:02:27,560 --> 00:02:28,040
穿好了
Good.

69
00:02:28,800 --> 00:02:30,480
你确定要给他穿这件吗
Uh, are you sure about that outfit?

70
00:02:32,200 --> 00:02:33,460
怎么总是发生这种事
Why does this keep happening?

71
00:02:33,660 --> 00:02:36,040
反正不是因为乔穿得像个成年人
Well, it's not because Joe dresses like an adult.

72
00:02:36,900 --> 00:02:38,098
我穿得很像成年人
I dress like an adult.

73
00:02:38,098 --> 00:02:40,440
电台司令演唱会那次你穿着闪光运动鞋
You wore light-up sneakers to a Radiohead concert.

74
00:02:40,440 --> 00:02:42,120
是的 而我们有没有走散呢
Yes. And did we ever get separated?

75
00:02:42,200 --> 00:02:43,620
我不是没有尝试过甩掉你
Not for lack of trying.

76
00:02:44,500 --> 00:02:45,700
天哪
Oh, my God.

77
00:02:45,740 --> 00:02:48,200
海莉 你不知道我扔那双鞋扔了多少次
Haley, the number of times I've thrown those shoes away.

78
00:02:48,200 --> 00:02:50,280
它们在垃圾堆里太容易被找到了
They're just too easy to spot in the trash.

79
00:02:50,426 --> 00:02:53,000
是的 继续笑吧
Oh, yes. Yuk it up.

80
00:02:53,000 --> 00:02:54,620
我去给他找件新上衣
I'm gonna go get him a new shirt.

81
00:02:57,080 --> 00:02:57,520
《金发姑娘》
"Goldilocks".

82
00:02:58,560 --> 00:03:00,920
这故事我妈妈给我读过无数次
My mom read this to me a thousand times.

83
00:03:01,460 --> 00:03:02,440
我一直不理解
I just never understood

84
00:03:02,440 --> 00:03:04,200
那个小姑娘是怎么幸免于难的
how that little girl got away with it.

85
00:03:04,340 --> 00:03:04,880
什么意思
What do you mean?

86
00:03:05,300 --> 00:03:06,556
如果我是故事里的那只熊
Well, if I were a bear

87
00:03:06,556 --> 00:03:08,520
有人闯进我家
and somebody broke into my house,

88
00:03:08,520 --> 00:03:10,420
睡了我的床 吃了我的食物
laid in my bed, and ate my food,

89
00:03:10,540 --> 00:03:12,260
我会把她的小细胳膊扯下来的
I'd rip her skinny little arms off.

90
00:03:13,787 --> 00:03:15,900
只是麦片粥而已 对吧
Well, it's just porridge, right?

91
00:03:15,900 --> 00:03:17,540
是我的麦片粥
It's my porridge.

92
00:03:19,220 --> 00:03:20,220
回来啦
There he is.

93
00:03:20,680 --> 00:03:23,300
真是怪了 我有一件一模一样的T恤
This is crazy, but I have this same shirt.

94
00:03:23,580 --> 00:03:25,000
你真可爱
You're so adorable.

95
00:03:25,520 --> 00:03:26,318
他是不是很可爱
Isn't he adorable?

96
00:03:26,318 --> 00:03:27,559
是吧
Y-yeah.

97
00:03:28,480 --> 00:03:29,800
我应该更经常离开房间的
I should leave the room more often.

98
00:03:29,900 --> 00:03:30,320
不要
No!

99
00:03:31,980 --> 00:03:33,220
奶酪可以搅拌吗
Can you blend cheese?

100
00:03:33,320 --> 00:03:35,020
我想不行 我也不想尝试
I don't think so, and I don't want to try it.

101
00:03:35,020 --> 00:03:36,400
我就是想喝杯奶昔或什么的
I just want a smoothie or something.

102
00:03:37,160 --> 00:03:37,820
你们好
Hey, guys!

103
00:03:37,832 --> 00:03:39,286
-天哪 -老天
- Oh, my gosh. - Oh, god.

104
00:03:39,500 --> 00:03:41,920
猜怎么着 他们接受了你们的出价
Guess what. They accepted your offer.

105
00:03:42,020 --> 00:03:43,620
天哪 太棒了
Oh, my gosh! That's fantastic!

106
00:03:44,080 --> 00:03:44,920
出什么价
What offer?

107
00:03:45,180 --> 00:03:46,600
我们要买下我们楼上那间公寓
We're buying the apartment upstairs from us.

108
00:03:46,860 --> 00:03:47,640
我们要扩充空间
We're gonna expand,

109
00:03:47,700 --> 00:03:49,238
给家里弄个像样的客房
put in a proper guest room,

110
00:03:49,238 --> 00:03:50,890
-还有办公室 -没错
- a home office. - Yeah.

111
00:03:50,890 --> 00:03:52,480
-很多空间 -是的
- So much space. - Yeah.

112
00:03:52,480 --> 00:03:52,920
恭喜了
Congrats!

113
00:03:53,200 --> 00:03:56,060
我要趁你再往屏幕上喷口水之前滚开了
I'm gonna roll away before you spit on my screen again.

114
00:03:57,160 --> 00:03:58,060
太棒了是不是
Isn't that great?

115
00:03:58,060 --> 00:03:59,320
是啊 很棒 很棒
Yeah. Oh, so great, so great.

116
00:04:00,400 --> 00:04:02,680
我以为米奇尔因为买下楼上的公寓这事
I thought Mitchell would be more excited

117
00:04:02,680 --> 00:04:03,600
应该会更激动些的
about the unit upstairs.

118
00:04:03,900 --> 00:04:05,160
他有什么心事
Something is going on with him.

119
00:04:05,220 --> 00:04:06,640
最近他对我有些冷漠
He's been more distant lately.

120
00:04:07,340 --> 00:04:08,120
过去两周里
For the last two weeks,

121
00:04:08,160 --> 00:04:10,620
他对下面的公寓也不大感兴趣
he hasn't been that interested in the unit downstairs, either.

122
00:04:12,660 --> 00:04:13,260
那是什么
What's that?

123
00:04:14,080 --> 00:04:14,980
菲尔 没什么
Phil, nothing.

124
00:04:15,600 --> 00:04:17,100
只是我要送给艾丽克斯的礼物
It's just a little gift I got Alex.

125
00:04:17,320 --> 00:04:18,769
但我们已经送过礼物了啊
But we already gave her our present.

126
00:04:18,769 --> 00:04:21,508
16件套拉杆箱超赞的
That 16-piece luggage set was a real winner.

127
00:04:21,508 --> 00:04:23,003
这是母亲送给女儿的礼物
This is more of a mother-daughter thing.

128
00:04:23,003 --> 00:04:25,160
是个钥匙扣 上面有一张我和艾丽克斯
It's just a key chain with a picture of me and Alex

129
00:04:25,160 --> 00:04:26,380
在她第一天上学时的合照
on her first day of school.

130
00:04:26,820 --> 00:04:27,740
我想要她拥有一件
I wanted her to have something

131
00:04:27,740 --> 00:04:29,220
能提醒她我有多爱她的东西
that reminded her of how much I love her.

132
00:04:29,460 --> 00:04:31,260
何不直接唱我给她写的那首歌啊
Why don't we just sing that song I wrote her?

133
00:04:32,740 --> 00:04:34,980
因为我不想唱那首无聊的歌
Because I don't want to sing that lame song.

134
00:04:36,860 --> 00:04:38,760
无聊 好吧
Lame. Okay.

135
00:04:38,760 --> 00:04:41,240
菲尔 没搞错吧 拜托
Phil, really? Come on.

136
00:04:41,300 --> 00:04:42,820
只有你才能伤到机器人
Only you could hurt a robot!

137
00:04:45,760 --> 00:04:47,600
你需要帮助吗
You, uh -- you need some help?

138
00:04:47,880 --> 00:04:48,260
好啊
Sure.

139
00:04:49,320 --> 00:04:51,160
我在想...
So, um, I was wondering --

140
00:04:51,280 --> 00:04:55,120
贝丝跟你说了我的什么事吗
Um, has Beth said anything to you about me, about...

141
00:04:55,740 --> 00:04:57,080
不喜欢我什么的
not liking me?

142
00:04:57,480 --> 00:04:58,360
你开玩笑吗
Are you kidding?

143
00:04:58,660 --> 00:04:59,900
贝丝非常喜欢你
Beth's obsessed with you.

144
00:04:59,920 --> 00:05:00,760
她总是说
She's always like,

145
00:05:01,300 --> 00:05:03,420
"海莉好可爱 我真想咬她的脸"
"Haley's so cute. I just want to bite her face."

146
00:05:03,640 --> 00:05:04,720
天啊
Oh, my God.

147
00:05:04,720 --> 00:05:06,223
她问我你在哪里工作
She asked me where you work,

148
00:05:06,223 --> 00:05:08,240
晚上去哪里 是不是一个人远足
where you go at night, whether you hike alone.

149
00:05:08,240 --> 00:05:10,940
实际上她很关心你
She's actually very concerned about you.

150
00:05:11,180 --> 00:05:12,480
有没有可能...
Or is it possible --

151
00:05:12,480 --> 00:05:13,440
你们聊些什么呢
What are you guys talking about?

152
00:05:13,980 --> 00:05:15,660
我只喜欢韩国男人
How I'm only into Korean dudes.

153
00:05:19,540 --> 00:05:20,440
好啊 亲爱的
Oh, hey, honey.

154
00:05:22,840 --> 00:05:23,520
好啊 菲尔
Hey, Phil.

155
00:05:24,140 --> 00:05:25,360
别转过来 装淡定
Hey, don't turn. Be cool, be cool.

156
00:05:26,340 --> 00:05:28,660
我需要你取消公寓这单生意
I need you to make this apartment thing go away.

157
00:05:28,960 --> 00:05:30,400
-什么 -我说了 装淡定
- What? - I said, "be cool."

158
00:05:32,020 --> 00:05:33,420
你为什么想取消啊
Why do you want it to go away?

159
00:05:34,140 --> 00:05:36,080
办公室裁减了预算
We had some budget cuts at the office,

160
00:05:36,080 --> 00:05:37,605
有几个人被辞退了
and a bunch of us got laid off.

161
00:05:37,605 --> 00:05:39,371
我没有告诉小卡 因为
Now -- now, I didn't tell Cam because...

162
00:05:39,480 --> 00:05:42,460
我觉得很丢脸 但也因为我知道
I was embarrassed, but also because I knew --

163
00:05:42,480 --> 00:05:44,320
我知道我分分钟就能找到新工作
I knew I would get another job like that.

164
00:05:45,260 --> 00:05:47,760
已经过去一个月了 现在好尴尬
It's been a month, and -- and now it's just weird

165
00:05:47,760 --> 00:05:49,140
我一开始没告诉他这事
that I didn't tell him in the first place,

166
00:05:49,220 --> 00:05:51,938
所以每天早上我假装去上班
So every morning, I leave for work.

167
00:05:51,938 --> 00:05:54,929
嗨哟嗨哟 我去上班啦
Well, heigh-ho, heigh-ho. It's off to work I go.

168
00:05:56,600 --> 00:05:58,640
我每天先是发简历
I send out my resume.

169
00:06:00,920 --> 00:06:02,840
像大部分对配偶隐瞒事实的
And then, like most unemployed people

170
00:06:02,840 --> 00:06:04,520
失业人员一样
hiding the truth from their spouses,

171
00:06:05,700 --> 00:06:07,200
我会去公园
I go to the park.

172
00:06:07,980 --> 00:06:11,040
有一天 我遇见了斯宾塞
And then, one day, I met Spencer.

173
00:06:11,680 --> 00:06:12,120
你好
Hello.

174
00:06:12,980 --> 00:06:15,280
现在我每天都和斯宾塞下棋
And now I play checkers with spencer.

175
00:06:15,680 --> 00:06:16,300
不
No!

176
00:06:18,360 --> 00:06:20,820
还有他最好的朋友 乔治
And his best friend, George,

177
00:06:21,360 --> 00:06:23,820
它帮我克服了一直以来对鸟的恐惧
who helped me get over my lifelong fear of birds.

178
00:06:23,960 --> 00:06:26,220
痒痒 别闹了
That tickles. Stop it! Stop it!

179
00:06:26,700 --> 00:06:29,040
米奇尔 你可以告诉我
Mitchell, you can talk to me.

180
00:06:29,080 --> 00:06:29,980
我是房地产经纪人
I'm a realtor.

181
00:06:29,980 --> 00:06:31,920
我需要你取消交易 好吗
I need you to kill the deal, okay?

182
00:06:32,140 --> 00:06:32,840
别告诉小卡
Don't tell Cam.

183
00:06:33,520 --> 00:06:33,860
米奇
Mitch...

184
00:06:40,100 --> 00:06:41,860
那是怎么回事 米奇尔说了什么
What was that about? What did Mitchell say?

185
00:06:42,580 --> 00:06:43,980
我是闻到了杰的拿手排骨吗
Do I smell Jay's famous ribs?

186
00:06:44,540 --> 00:06:45,980
菲尔 菲尔
Phil. Phil.

187
00:06:54,720 --> 00:06:56,780
冷静 歌洛莉亚需要餐巾环
Calm down. Gloria needs napkin rings.

188
00:06:56,880 --> 00:06:59,020
我要举起你 你看看高层架子
I'm gonna hold you up. You can check the high shelves.

189
00:06:59,220 --> 00:07:00,980
使劲举 我中午吃了很多
Lift with your legs. I had a big lunch.

190
00:07:07,020 --> 00:07:08,640
我没看见有餐巾环
I don't see any napkin rings.

191
00:07:08,640 --> 00:07:10,740
只看到一个写着西班牙语的盒子
I just see a box with some Spanish written on it.

192
00:07:10,740 --> 00:07:12,113
可能就是了
Oh, that's probably it.

193
00:07:22,360 --> 00:07:24,680
克罗基特和塔布斯 那可是海洛因
Crockett and Tubbs! That's heroin!

194
00:07:24,960 --> 00:07:25,226
什么
What?!

195
00:07:25,226 --> 00:07:28,120
你懂的 白粉 白面 四号仔
You know, horse, smack, hell dust.

196
00:07:28,120 --> 00:07:29,815
我知道外号 我看过《侦探科杰克》
I know the nicknames. I've watched "Kojak".

197
00:07:29,815 --> 00:07:33,020
我敢肯定是歌洛莉亚的那个人渣表亲
I guarantee that low-life cousin of Gloria's

198
00:07:33,020 --> 00:07:33,940
藏在这里的
stashed this up there.

199
00:07:34,400 --> 00:07:36,020
杰 餐巾环呢
Jay, where are the napkin rings?

200
00:07:36,260 --> 00:07:37,860
我给你们一点隐私吧
I'll give you guys some privacy.

201
00:07:38,880 --> 00:07:40,300
瞧瞧你表亲在这里藏了什么
Look what your cousin's hiding in here.

202
00:07:40,760 --> 00:07:41,660
这是我的马[白粉]
That's my horse.

203
00:07:42,545 --> 00:07:43,500
这是你的
That's yours?

204
00:07:43,500 --> 00:07:45,040
是啊 我从哥伦比亚带来的
Yes, I brought it back from Colombia.

205
00:07:45,160 --> 00:07:47,480
天啊 我娶了个贩毒集团的人吗
My god. I married into a drug cartel?

206
00:07:47,620 --> 00:07:50,480
这是我死去的马儿加乌乔的骨灰
These are the ashes of my dead horse, Gaucho.

207
00:07:50,660 --> 00:07:52,540
我小时候养的他
I had him when I was a little girl.

208
00:07:54,620 --> 00:07:56,478
你觉得这是毒品
You thought that these were drugs

209
00:07:56,478 --> 00:07:58,340
而且是我表亲的吗
and that they belong to my cousin?

210
00:07:58,340 --> 00:07:59,780
不然我该怎么想啊
Well, what was I supposed to think?

211
00:07:59,880 --> 00:08:01,100
我受够了 杰
I am sick of this, Jay.

212
00:08:01,160 --> 00:08:03,657
你把我的家人当做罪犯
You treat my family like they're criminals.

213
00:08:03,657 --> 00:08:07,060
好像他会带价值十五万美金的海洛因
Like he would bring $150,000 worth of

214
00:08:07,060 --> 00:08:08,780
来这里一样
heroin into this house!

215
00:08:09,160 --> 00:08:10,380
你怎么知道这值多少钱
How do you know how much --

216
00:08:10,380 --> 00:08:12,140
怎么 我就不能知道街头黑市价吗
What?! I can't know street value?!

217
00:08:16,260 --> 00:08:18,440
艾丽克斯 亲爱的 能耽误你一会儿吗
Alex, honey, could I borrow you for a minute?

218
00:08:18,800 --> 00:08:19,200
稍等
One sec.

219
00:08:19,780 --> 00:08:21,660
米奇舅舅 这太棒了
Uncle Mitch, this is amazing.

220
00:08:21,660 --> 00:08:23,720
你居然留着这些东西
I can't believe you kept all of this.

221
00:08:23,780 --> 00:08:24,740
没什么特别的啦
Oh, it's nothing special.

222
00:08:26,320 --> 00:08:28,580
里面是你给我写的每一张便条和画的每一幅画
of every note and drawing you ever made me.

223
00:08:29,146 --> 00:08:31,286
你在开玩笑吧
You got to be kidding me.

224
00:08:31,286 --> 00:08:32,716
你好
Oh, oh. Hola.

225
00:08:34,300 --> 00:08:35,200
这很不错
This is good.

226
00:08:35,240 --> 00:08:36,039
这是你四岁时
This is a report card

227
00:08:36,039 --> 00:08:37,604
给我做的明信片
that you made for me when you were 4,

228
00:08:37,604 --> 00:08:40,200
你给我这个舅舅打了B-的分数
And you gave me a b-minus as an uncle.

229
00:08:40,200 --> 00:08:42,780
我很生气 因为你投了拉尔夫·纳德的票
I was mad because you wasted your vote on Ralph Nader.

230
00:08:43,299 --> 00:08:45,180
而今天你拿到了A+
But today, you get an A-plus,

231
00:08:45,180 --> 00:08:47,040
因为这是有史以来最有心思的礼物
because this is the most thoughtful gift ever.

232
00:08:48,380 --> 00:08:52,300
米奇尔 你怎么会有时间做这个的
Oh, Mitchell, where do you even find the time for this?

233
00:08:53,000 --> 00:08:55,760
所以这个是放这里还是这里呢
So, this one -- here or here?

234
00:08:55,760 --> 00:08:57,260
我不确定
I don't know.

235
00:08:57,260 --> 00:08:58,740
放这里如何
What about here?

236
00:09:00,080 --> 00:09:00,500
斯宾塞
Spencer!

237
00:09:02,320 --> 00:09:04,921
各位 我随口问一句
Hey, guys, so, a random question,

238
00:09:04,921 --> 00:09:06,200
你们中有谁
but, um, do any of you

239
00:09:06,200 --> 00:09:08,380
觉得贝丝怪怪的吗
get kind of a weird vibe from Beth?

240
00:09:08,540 --> 00:09:10,620
就是有点不正常那种
You know, like maybe something's a little off?

241
00:09:10,940 --> 00:09:12,599
贝丝 怎么会 她超棒的
Beth? No. She's an angel.

242
00:09:12,599 --> 00:09:14,113
对啊 她人可好了
Yeah, she seems super-sweet.

243
00:09:14,113 --> 00:09:16,296
你还真是不怕用带S的词
You're really not shying away from those "S" words, are you?

244
00:09:16,419 --> 00:09:17,480
所以没人觉得
S-so, no one thinks

245
00:09:17,480 --> 00:09:19,860
贝丝有点诡异吗
that Beth has maybe, like, a slightly psychotic side?

246
00:09:21,160 --> 00:09:23,220
我知道是怎么回事了
I see what's going on here.

247
00:09:24,220 --> 00:09:25,241
有人嫉妒了
Somebody's jealous

248
00:09:25,241 --> 00:09:27,100
因为她不再是这里
'cause she's not the only pretty girl

249
00:09:27,100 --> 00:09:28,240
唯一的小美女了 对吧
around here anymore, hmm?

250
00:09:29,740 --> 00:09:30,400
我可谢谢你了 老妈
Thanks, mom.

251
00:09:30,669 --> 00:09:32,326
贝丝超性感
Beth's super-hot.

252
00:09:32,360 --> 00:09:34,580
要是海岸巡逻队员都长那样
If everyone in the coast guard looks like that,

253
00:09:34,740 --> 00:09:35,560
我也去报名
sign me up.

254
00:09:35,900 --> 00:09:37,400
只在周末工作对吧
It's just on the weekends, right?

255
00:09:37,640 --> 00:09:39,040
算了 你们都真没用
Forget it. You're all useless.

256
00:09:43,522 --> 00:09:45,170
-是谁啊 -工作上的事
- Who was that? - Oh, it's just work.

257
00:09:46,500 --> 00:09:49,580
我有一条绝对的底线
There is a line that I will not cross.

258
00:09:49,880 --> 00:09:53,200
只要碰了他的手机 就是怀疑他的忠贞
As soon as I touch that phone, I'm a suspicious spouse,

259
00:09:53,200 --> 00:09:55,080
我不是那种人
and that is not me.

260
00:09:56,240 --> 00:09:58,160
所以我跟服务员说
So, I say to the waitress...

261
00:10:00,640 --> 00:10:02,940
我看到你倒的是普通咖啡
"I saw you pour from the regular pot."

262
00:10:03,698 --> 00:10:05,369
然后她说 不是
And, um, she's like, "Nope.

263
00:10:05,369 --> 00:10:07,620
我倒的是低咖啡因的
I, uh, poured from the decaf pot".

264
00:10:07,620 --> 00:10:08,700
天哪
You know? Oh, my gosh.

265
00:10:09,500 --> 00:10:10,920
我来捡
Let me get that.

266
00:10:13,100 --> 00:10:15,040
快点说 别吊我胃口
Come on. Don't leave me hanging.

267
00:10:15,380 --> 00:10:16,140
你是不是整晚都没睡着
Were you up all night?

268
00:10:16,560 --> 00:10:17,700
"跟你玩得很开心 斯宾塞"
"Had fun with you. Spencer.

269
00:10:18,240 --> 00:10:19,640
"周一见 斯宾塞"
See you ,Monday. Spencer.

270
00:10:20,120 --> 00:10:21,220
"笑脸 斯宾塞"
Smiley face. Spencer".

271
00:10:21,760 --> 00:10:22,720
斯宾塞是谁
Who is Spencer?!

272
00:10:24,920 --> 00:10:26,000
邓先生
Hey, Mr. D.

273
00:10:26,860 --> 00:10:27,600
我们能聊一下吗
Can we talk?

274
00:10:27,860 --> 00:10:29,300
当然 想喝点儿什么
Sure thing. What'll you have?

275
00:10:31,180 --> 00:10:32,040
怎么了
What's up?

276
00:10:32,400 --> 00:10:33,820
我接到了
So, I've been...

277
00:10:33,820 --> 00:10:35,700
贝丝的暗示
getting some signals from Beth

278
00:10:35,700 --> 00:10:37,560
她想让我求婚
that she wants me to propose.

279
00:10:37,880 --> 00:10:38,740
真是激动人心
That's exciting.

280
00:10:38,900 --> 00:10:40,500
对啊 我连戒指都准备好了
Yeah. I even have ring.

281
00:10:40,610 --> 00:10:42,340
那你还犹豫什么呢
So, what's the hold-up?

282
00:10:42,340 --> 00:10:44,540
其实 还有另外一个女孩
Well... there's this other girl,

283
00:10:44,540 --> 00:10:48,740
我感觉自己被她深深地吸引
and I feel like I have a serious connection with her,

284
00:10:48,740 --> 00:10:51,540
可我不知道她是怎么想的
but... I just don't know how she feels.

285
00:10:51,960 --> 00:10:53,680
安迪 我当年跟克莱尔约会时
Andy, back when I was dating Claire,

286
00:10:53,780 --> 00:10:56,080
我想过假如哪天在自助洗衣店里
I used to think, "What if I'm in the laundromat one day,

287
00:10:56,080 --> 00:10:57,740
罗宾·吉文斯[泰森前妻]走进来
and Robin Givens walks in?"

288
00:10:58,420 --> 00:10:59,880
她问我要一个25美分硬币
She asks me for a quarter.

289
00:11:00,060 --> 00:11:01,180
我拿给她
I hand her one.

290
00:11:01,480 --> 00:11:02,580
我们手指相触
Our fingers linger.

291
00:11:03,540 --> 00:11:05,940
她会想在拳王泰森之后
She wonders if maybe after "Iron Mike",

292
00:11:06,480 --> 00:11:07,660
她最渴望的其实是
what she's really yearning for

293
00:11:07,660 --> 00:11:09,200
一位温柔绅士的触碰
is the touch of a gentler man.

294
00:11:10,420 --> 00:11:11,260
我没听明白
I'm not following.

295
00:11:11,640 --> 00:11:13,780
人天性就喜欢幻想不同的人生
It's natural to wonder about a different path,

296
00:11:13,780 --> 00:11:17,200
可如果你真的爱贝丝 那就应该求婚
but if you truly love Beth, you should propose.

297
00:11:17,720 --> 00:11:19,380
你说的没错 我会的
You're right. I'll do it.

298
00:11:19,620 --> 00:11:21,440
海边有个她很喜欢的地方
There's this place she loves by the ocean.

299
00:11:21,720 --> 00:11:23,480
我要带她去那里 在夕阳中求婚
I'll take her there and propose at sunset.

300
00:11:23,660 --> 00:11:24,180
真棒
Great!

301
00:11:24,540 --> 00:11:25,440
非常感谢
Thank you so much.

302
00:11:25,960 --> 00:11:26,800
来抱一个
Bring it in.

303
00:11:28,220 --> 00:11:30,280
拜托 去开房吧
Oh, come on. Get a roomba.

304
00:11:33,333 --> 00:11:35,020
亲爱的 钥匙链不够好
Honey, the key chain was a bust.

305
00:11:35,020 --> 00:11:36,068
我需要别的东西 快点 想一个
I need something else. Quick. Come on.

306
00:11:36,068 --> 00:11:38,080
明白 你想唱那首歌
Got it. You want to sing the song.

307
00:11:38,080 --> 00:11:40,100
幸好我旅行中带着尤克里里
Good thing I brought my ukulele on the trip.

308
00:11:40,460 --> 00:11:40,800
旅行
Trip!

309
00:11:41,720 --> 00:11:43,120
艾丽克斯小的时候 我曾带她去
When Alex was little, I took her for brunch

310
00:11:43,120 --> 00:11:45,000
北边的那个荷兰小镇吃早午餐
at that cute little Dutch town up north.

311
00:11:45,000 --> 00:11:47,300
我可以再带她去一趟
I-I could take her there again.

312
00:11:47,300 --> 00:11:49,420
只属于我们母女的旅程 太棒了
A trip for just the two of us. It's perfect.

313
00:11:51,060 --> 00:11:52,980
*当你没有...*
*When you don't --*

314
00:11:52,980 --> 00:11:53,100
克莱尔
Claire?

315
00:11:56,880 --> 00:11:58,560
艾丽克斯 宝贝 你还记得
Alex, honey, do you remember --

316
00:11:58,560 --> 00:11:59,120
天哪 妈妈
Oh, my God, Mom!

317
00:11:59,380 --> 00:12:01,240
外公送我欧洲之旅庆祝毕业
Grandpa got me a trip to Europe for my graduation!

318
00:12:01,260 --> 00:12:03,500
我想让她知道她对我有多重要
I just wanted her to know how much she meant to me.

319
00:12:05,420 --> 00:12:06,980
我讨厌这一家子
I hate this family.

320
00:12:07,899 --> 00:12:10,179
菲尔 我需要跟你进行男人之间的谈话
Phil, I need to talk to you, man-to-man.

321
00:12:10,360 --> 00:12:11,920
我觉得米奇尔出轨了
I think Mitchell's having an affair.

322
00:12:12,480 --> 00:12:12,920
什么
What?

323
00:12:12,980 --> 00:12:14,240
我翻他钱包的时候
I was going through his wallet

324
00:12:14,240 --> 00:12:17,120
找到了笑袅酒店的收据
and I found a receipt to the Avian Hotel.

325
00:12:17,480 --> 00:12:18,880
有可能是他跟情人
It's probably some fancy French place

326
00:12:18,880 --> 00:12:19,800
周末偷偷约会的
where he's meeting his lover

327
00:12:19,800 --> 00:12:21,620
某个高级法式酒店
for their secret weekly rendezvous.

328
00:12:22,380 --> 00:12:25,480
他跟你聊过关于楼上那套房的事吗
Has he said anything to you about the unit upstairs?

329
00:12:26,840 --> 00:12:27,800
你倒吸气了
You gasped.

330
00:12:28,080 --> 00:12:29,240
因为你先倒吸气了啊
Only because you did.

331
00:12:29,320 --> 00:12:31,700
菲尔 告诉我你知道什么
Phil, tell me what you know right now.

332
00:12:31,700 --> 00:12:33,480
我什么都不知道 放我下来
I don't know anything. Put me down.

333
00:12:34,280 --> 00:12:35,320
跟你老公谈谈
Talk to your husband.

334
00:12:36,375 --> 00:12:39,035
这是我的钱包 你没见过我
This is my wallet. You never saw me.

335
00:12:42,060 --> 00:12:43,760
斯黛拉 不要 坏孩子
Stella, no. Bad girl.

336
00:12:44,500 --> 00:12:47,000
坏孩子 斯黛拉 不要
Bad girl. Stella, no.

337
00:12:47,400 --> 00:12:48,040
斯黛拉 不要
Stella, no.

338
00:12:48,952 --> 00:12:51,120
莉莉在台子上撒了些果汁
Lily spilled some juice on the counter.

339
00:12:51,120 --> 00:12:52,120
我该搜搜看她身上有没有枪吗
Should I frisk her for guns?

340
00:12:52,260 --> 00:12:53,020
老天
Oh, geez.

341
00:12:53,832 --> 00:12:55,063
打扰了
Oh, sorry.

342
00:12:55,063 --> 00:12:56,575
杰 不要
Jay, no!

343
00:12:57,920 --> 00:12:58,520
海莉
Haley!

344
00:12:59,240 --> 00:13:00,620
快过来看
Come check it out.

345
00:13:00,940 --> 00:13:02,120
我在教卢克和曼尼一些
I was just showing Luke and Manny

346
00:13:02,120 --> 00:13:03,840
我在海岸警卫队训练学到的技能
some things that I learned in coast guard training.

347
00:13:05,040 --> 00:13:05,620
你好美
You look so pretty.

348
00:13:06,615 --> 00:13:08,780
好了 曼尼 把这支笔从我手上拿走
All right, Manny, take this pen from me.

349
00:13:09,400 --> 00:13:10,940
你是要我就这么拿吗
So, you just want me to grab it?

350
00:13:12,740 --> 00:13:13,220
看见了吧
See?

351
00:13:13,740 --> 00:13:14,700
如果有人
That's what you do

352
00:13:14,700 --> 00:13:16,640
要抢走属于你的东西 你就用这招
when someone tries to take something that's yours.

353
00:13:17,960 --> 00:13:18,440
帅爆了
Awesome.

354
00:13:19,040 --> 00:13:19,580
到我了
My turn.

355
00:13:20,181 --> 00:13:22,420
怎么回事 我拿到笔了吗
What happened? Did I get the pen?

356
00:13:23,540 --> 00:13:24,940
你的头发烧着了
Hey, your hair's burning!

357
00:13:25,200 --> 00:13:25,680
什么
What?!

358
00:13:25,680 --> 00:13:26,916
我的天
Oh my God!

359
00:13:26,916 --> 00:13:28,640
你的头发
Ay! Your hair!

360
00:13:28,640 --> 00:13:29,260
我来搞定
I got it!

361
00:13:31,220 --> 00:13:32,820
灭了 灭了
It's out! It's out!

362
00:13:33,120 --> 00:13:34,080
怎么回事
What happened?

363
00:13:34,500 --> 00:13:35,760
一定是被那根蜡烛烧着了
It must have been that candle.

364
00:13:36,160 --> 00:13:37,560
你为什么坐得离它那么近
Why'd you sit so close to it?

365
00:13:37,640 --> 00:13:38,797
她让我坐这儿的
She told me to!

366
00:13:38,797 --> 00:13:41,440
贝丝 多亏有你在这里
Ay, Beth, thank God that you were here.

367
00:13:41,440 --> 00:13:42,660
很高兴我能帮上忙
I'm just glad I could help.

368
00:13:43,400 --> 00:13:45,000
这里发生的事情太疯狂了
It's getting crazy in here.

369
00:13:46,382 --> 00:13:48,009
你想不想去泳池里冷静一下
You want to cool things off in the pool?

370
00:13:55,180 --> 00:13:55,700
杰
Jay!

371
00:13:57,220 --> 00:13:58,020
谢天谢地
Oh, thank God.

372
00:13:58,440 --> 00:13:59,217
原来你在这儿
There you are.

373
00:13:59,217 --> 00:14:01,381
我跟你说 你肯定不
Okay, you are -- you're never...

374
00:14:01,457 --> 00:14:03,960
你肯定不会相信我爸做了什么
You're never gonna believe what my dad did.

375
00:14:03,960 --> 00:14:05,340
-把你锁在厕所里吗 -不是
- Lock you in the bathroom? - No.

376
00:14:05,580 --> 00:14:09,320
他送艾丽克斯欧洲行作为毕业礼物
He gave Alex a trip to Europe for her graduation present.

377
00:14:09,600 --> 00:14:10,900
这么一来我周末带她去
There's no way I can now give her

378
00:14:10,900 --> 00:14:12,860
吃荷兰煎饼球的计划就太逊色了
a weekend of Dutch pancake balls after that.

379
00:14:13,160 --> 00:14:14,836
你能把门打开吗 我有点透不过气的感觉
Can you open the door? I'm feeling claustrophobic.

380
00:14:14,836 --> 00:14:17,558
菲尔 你现在在西雅图的酒店房间里
Phil, you're in a hotel room in Seattle.

381
00:14:17,558 --> 00:14:20,920
我真的绝望了 快点教我唱那首歌
I'm desperate. Just teach me the song.

382
00:14:20,920 --> 00:14:24,160
哎哟喂 看看这是谁在巴结我啊
Well, well, well. Look who came crawling back.

383
00:14:24,160 --> 00:14:25,200
赶紧教我唱
Just teach it to me.

384
00:14:25,880 --> 00:14:26,360
好哒
Okay.

385
00:14:26,420 --> 00:14:29,040
这首歌叫做《有事就找艾丽克斯》
It's called "Go Ask Alex".

386
00:14:31,000 --> 00:14:34,040
*如果你有单词不知道意思*
*When you don't know what a word means*

387
00:14:34,040 --> 00:14:35,600
*就找艾丽克斯*
*Go ask Alex*

388
00:14:35,660 --> 00:14:37,880
*如果你有牛仔裤需要缝边*
*If you need someone to hem your jeans*

389
00:14:37,880 --> 00:14:38,920
*就找艾丽克斯*
*Go ask Alex*

390
00:14:38,940 --> 00:14:40,500
不敢相信我居然要说这话
I can't believe I'm even saying this,

391
00:14:40,660 --> 00:14:41,640
但把"有牛仔裤需要卷边"换成
but instead of "Hem your jeans",

392
00:14:41,640 --> 00:14:43,440
"有绿叶菜需要蒸好"岂不是更好
could it be "Steam your greens"?

393
00:14:43,680 --> 00:14:44,419
不能改
No, it can't.

394
00:14:44,419 --> 00:14:46,232
唱到第四分钟牛仔裤这段要重复
The jeans come back at the 4-minute mark.

395
00:14:49,660 --> 00:14:50,220
海莉
Haley.

396
00:14:51,280 --> 00:14:51,720
你怎么样了
How you feeling?

397
00:14:52,300 --> 00:14:54,140
我听说你的头发烧着了 好可怕
Heard about the hair fire. Sounds scary.

398
00:14:55,660 --> 00:14:56,460
可怜的娃
Poor thing.

399
00:14:56,940 --> 00:14:59,100
我准备了个小礼物 放在你车上了
I left you a gift on your car to help you feel better.

400
00:14:59,460 --> 00:15:00,540
是红色的那辆 对吧
It's the red one, right?

401
00:15:04,020 --> 00:15:06,840
你能帮我启动一下我的车子吗
Hey, can you do me a favor and go start my car?

402
00:15:07,480 --> 00:15:08,660
好吧
Uh, I guess.

403
00:15:09,100 --> 00:15:09,660
谢谢
Thanks.

404
00:15:10,840 --> 00:15:12,900
他没死 没事没事
He's alive. It's fine.

405
00:15:13,660 --> 00:15:15,960
好啦 大家都过来一下
Okay, everybody gather 'round.

406
00:15:15,960 --> 00:15:20,340
菲尔和我给我们聪明的毕业生艾丽克斯
Phil and I have prepared something very special

407
00:15:20,340 --> 00:15:22,880
准备了一个特别的贺礼
for our brilliant graduate, Alex.

408
00:15:23,020 --> 00:15:24,100
你准备好了吗
Okay, you ready?

409
00:15:25,360 --> 00:15:26,420
*当你...*
*When you...*

410
00:15:28,140 --> 00:15:29,780
怎么搞的 怎么没声音
Why is that not -- okay, there's no sound.

411
00:15:29,840 --> 00:15:31,120
菲尔 亲爱的 你那边没声音
Phil, honey? There's no sound.

412
00:15:31,220 --> 00:15:33,740
趁着克莱尔修理机器人菲尔这会儿
Okay, so, while Claire fixes robot Phil,

413
00:15:33,740 --> 00:15:34,760
我来致个辞
I make toast.

414
00:15:35,740 --> 00:15:37,780
我刚刚来到这个家时
When I first came into this family,

415
00:15:37,780 --> 00:15:41,300
我以为我永远不会被你们接纳
I didn't think I was ever going to be accepted.

416
00:15:42,160 --> 00:15:43,040
直到有一天
Then, one day,

417
00:15:43,040 --> 00:15:46,280
艾丽克斯要写关于某个家庭成员的报告
Alex needed to write a report about a family member,

418
00:15:47,440 --> 00:15:49,280
她选了我
and she picked me.

419
00:15:49,980 --> 00:15:52,940
那是我第一次觉得自己真的是家中一员
That was the first time I really felt part of the family.

420
00:15:54,020 --> 00:15:56,880
艾丽克斯 你是第一个向我示好的人
Ay, Alex, you were the first one to reach out to me,

421
00:15:56,880 --> 00:15:58,800
我永远不会忘记的
and I will never forget that.

422
00:15:59,560 --> 00:16:01,040
他们都说你是最聪明的
They all call you the smart one,

423
00:16:01,040 --> 00:16:03,760
但是对我来说 你是最善良的
but to me, you're the kind one.

424
00:16:04,420 --> 00:16:07,000
生命中有你 我真的太幸运了 宝贝
I'm so lucky to have you in my life, baby.

425
00:16:07,240 --> 00:16:07,580
歌洛莉亚
Gloria.

426
00:16:08,035 --> 00:16:08,887
说得太好了
Hear, hear.

427
00:16:10,020 --> 00:16:11,140
终于听到了
Oh, there you are.

428
00:16:11,279 --> 00:16:11,897
*当你有单词不知...*
*When you don't know what a word -- *

429
00:16:11,897 --> 00:16:14,219
别唱了 别唱了 我们现在不唱了
No, not doing it, not doing it. We're not -- not doing it.

430
00:16:15,960 --> 00:16:16,880
等我一下
One second.

431
00:16:24,360 --> 00:16:26,680
歌洛莉亚 听你致辞
Gloria, watching you give that toast,

432
00:16:26,820 --> 00:16:28,420
我意识到你把我的家人视为你的亲人
I see you treat my family like your own.

433
00:16:28,420 --> 00:16:29,000
你说的很对
And you're right.

434
00:16:29,420 --> 00:16:31,000
我也要对你表亲好一点
I need to treat your cousin nicer.

435
00:16:31,300 --> 00:16:32,120
谢谢你 杰
Thank you, Jay.

436
00:16:34,960 --> 00:16:38,500
告诉阿尔曼多我很抱歉没有好好招待他
Tell Armando I'm sorry I haven't been more welcoming to him.

437
00:16:40,980 --> 00:16:43,160
告诉他他是个好人
Tell him he's a great guy.

438
00:16:45,860 --> 00:16:47,820
他想在这待多久就待多久
And he can stay as long as he wants.

439
00:16:50,620 --> 00:16:51,500
我们原谅你了
We forgive you.

440
00:16:51,800 --> 00:16:53,320
真的吗 要不我给他个拥抱什么的
You sure? Maybe I can give him a little hug or something.

441
00:16:53,400 --> 00:16:54,620
不 太过头了
No, it's too much.

442
00:16:56,410 --> 00:16:57,289
走好
Bye-bye.

443
00:17:00,220 --> 00:17:02,319
我受够了 我必须要搞清楚
Okay, I've had enough. I need to know.

444
00:17:02,319 --> 00:17:03,980
这个金贵的斯宾塞是谁
Who is this precious Spencer?

445
00:17:03,980 --> 00:17:05,420
天呐 你怎么知道斯宾塞的
Oh, God. How do you know about Spencer?

446
00:17:05,540 --> 00:17:06,460
也就是说你承认了
So you admit it.

447
00:17:06,460 --> 00:17:07,560
你有外遇了
You are having an affair.

448
00:17:08,040 --> 00:17:10,040
-什么 -是因为我的牙套对不对
- What? - It's the braces, isn't it?

449
00:17:10,185 --> 00:17:11,820
我把你吓走了 我实在太丑了
I've driven you to stray. I'm hideous.

450
00:17:11,820 --> 00:17:12,920
小卡 你这简直是疯了
Cam, you're acting crazy.

451
00:17:13,040 --> 00:17:13,880
是吗 米奇尔
Am I? Mitchell...

452
00:17:14,853 --> 00:17:16,854
我发现了笑袅酒店的收据
I found the receipt to the Avian Hotel.

453
00:17:16,854 --> 00:17:18,280
正确的读音是"小鸟"
That's pronounced "Ay-vee-ann."

454
00:17:18,280 --> 00:17:19,160
反正听上去很寒酸
Well, it sounds seedy.

455
00:17:19,300 --> 00:17:21,200
没错 那是个鸟类收容所
It is. It's a kennel for birds.

456
00:17:21,340 --> 00:17:22,340
我得去那里接乔治
It's where I picked up George.

457
00:17:22,420 --> 00:17:23,520
竟然还有个乔治
There's a George, too?

458
00:17:23,740 --> 00:17:26,040
淡定 我指的是一只白鹦鹉[一两根鸡鸡]
Calm down. I'm talking about a cockatoo.

459
00:17:26,055 --> 00:17:29,260
一两根啊 仅此而已吗 真无趣啊
One or two. Is that all? How blasé?

460
00:17:29,260 --> 00:17:30,780
小卡 乔治是一只鸟
Cam, George is a bird,

461
00:17:30,780 --> 00:17:33,340
斯宾塞是最近在公园里跟我一起玩的老人
and Spencer is an old man I've been hanging out with at the park,

462
00:17:33,340 --> 00:17:35,560
因为我...
because I...

463
00:17:35,560 --> 00:17:36,720
我被裁员了
I got laid off.

464
00:17:36,720 --> 00:17:37,760
你失业了吗
You lost your job?

465
00:17:37,880 --> 00:17:38,840
对不起 我...
I'm sorry. I just --

466
00:17:38,840 --> 00:17:41,399
我没脸告诉你我又失业了
I couldn't tell you that I was out of work again.

467
00:17:41,399 --> 00:17:44,181
我感觉自己好失败
I...I feel like such a loser.

468
00:17:44,181 --> 00:17:45,360
不 别这么说 天啊
No, please. My gosh.

469
00:17:45,360 --> 00:17:46,940
只要你没背着我找小三就行了
As long as you're not cheating on me,

470
00:17:46,940 --> 00:17:47,940
那才是真正重要的
that's all that matters.

471
00:17:48,620 --> 00:17:50,615
肯定会有其他机会的 你是个出色的律师
Something will come up. You're a great lawyer.

472
00:17:50,615 --> 00:17:52,120
谢谢 我只是...
Oh, thank you. I just --

473
00:17:52,120 --> 00:17:54,520
我觉得我们现在没办法买下那间公寓了
I don't think that we can get that apartment right now.

474
00:17:54,640 --> 00:17:55,580
当然可以买了
Of course we can.

475
00:17:55,580 --> 00:17:56,820
我们已经有首付款了
We already have the down payment.

476
00:17:56,980 --> 00:17:58,520
再说我们还可以租出去呢
And you know what? We could get renters.

477
00:17:58,900 --> 00:18:00,360
我们可以把它变成家庭旅馆
We could it into an Airbnb.

478
00:18:01,160 --> 00:18:03,081
不是吧 每周都来不同的住客吗
Really? Different people every week?

479
00:18:03,081 --> 00:18:05,319
很新鲜刺激啊 就跟电视剧《爱之船》一样
How exciting and new. It'd be like "The Love Boat".

480
00:18:07,120 --> 00:18:08,520
妈 你有空吗[要第二杯吗]
Hey, Mom, have a second?

481
00:18:09,220 --> 00:18:10,040
已经在喝了
Already am.

482
00:18:11,400 --> 00:18:12,860
我想送你一份礼物
I wanted to give you a present.

483
00:18:13,380 --> 00:18:14,660
我吗 不是吧
Me? No.

484
00:18:14,920 --> 00:18:16,760
亲爱的 我想送你一份礼物才对
Honey, I want to give you a present.

485
00:18:16,840 --> 00:18:18,820
我已经绞尽脑汁想了一天该送你什么
That's what I've been trying to do all day.

486
00:18:18,820 --> 00:18:22,104
你是最不需要送我任何礼物的人了
You are the last person who should give me anything.

487
00:18:23,100 --> 00:18:24,500
是你帮我走到今天
You got me here.

488
00:18:25,060 --> 00:18:27,360
你抚养我到成功毕业 进入加州理工学院
You got me to graduation, to Caltech.

489
00:18:29,080 --> 00:18:29,880
这都是你的功劳
You did it.

490
00:18:30,324 --> 00:18:31,569
你的任务已经完成了
And you're done.

491
00:18:31,720 --> 00:18:34,480
谢谢你 亲爱的 谢谢 我爱你
Thank you, sweetie. Thank you. I love you.

492
00:18:35,100 --> 00:18:36,820
我想让你跟我一起去欧洲旅行
I want you to go to Europe with me.

493
00:18:37,020 --> 00:18:37,951
什么
What?!

494
00:18:38,200 --> 00:18:39,596
没错 我们会玩得很开心的
Yeah. We'll have a great time.

495
00:18:39,596 --> 00:18:41,080
各种咖啡馆 博物馆
Cafés, museums,

496
00:18:41,080 --> 00:18:43,120
再说了 欧洲对少女来说可不安全
plus, Europe is not safe for teenage girls.

497
00:18:43,140 --> 00:18:43,840
你看过《飓风营救》吧
You've seen "Taken"?

498
00:18:44,120 --> 00:18:45,720
你能想象爸爸要是收到那通电话会怎样吗
Could you imagine dad getting that phone call?

499
00:18:45,940 --> 00:18:48,100
他能有什么特殊技能啊
What is his particular set of skills?

500
00:18:48,620 --> 00:18:49,100
变魔术吗
Juggling?

501
00:18:50,940 --> 00:18:52,740
老爸 我们能谈谈吗
Hey, Dad, can we talk?

502
00:18:52,920 --> 00:18:54,200
-当然了 亲爱的 -私下里谈
- Sure, honey. - In private.

503
00:18:54,780 --> 00:18:56,540
别那么用力 我无法呼吸了
Oh, not so hard. I can't breathe.

504
00:18:57,160 --> 00:18:58,260
机器人的小笑话
Little robot humor.

505
00:19:01,520 --> 00:19:04,080
我注意到你听到我的机器人笑话并没有笑
I noticed you didn't laugh at my robot joke.

506
00:19:04,140 --> 00:19:05,040
出什么事了
What's going on?

507
00:19:05,300 --> 00:19:06,700
大家都觉得贝丝超级好
Everyone thinks Beth is so great,

508
00:19:06,700 --> 00:19:07,820
但我觉得她是个疯子
but I think she's crazy.

509
00:19:07,880 --> 00:19:09,300
她已经针对我一整天了
She's been after me all day.

510
00:19:09,700 --> 00:19:11,080
她为什么要针对你
Why would she be after you?

511
00:19:11,240 --> 00:19:12,780
她觉得我爱上安迪了
She thinks I'm in love with Andy.

512
00:19:13,680 --> 00:19:14,360
那你有吗
Are you?

513
00:19:14,560 --> 00:19:16,440
没有 我的确关心他
No. I mean, I care about him.

514
00:19:16,440 --> 00:19:18,660
他能逗我笑 我喜欢跟他一起玩
He makes me laugh. I like spending time with him.

515
00:19:19,060 --> 00:19:21,260
当他不在你身边时 你会想他吗
Well, do you think about him when he's not around?

516
00:19:21,640 --> 00:19:22,620
会吧
I guess.

517
00:19:23,620 --> 00:19:26,180
有时候 我看到一些好笑的事 就会心想
Sometimes, I see something funny and I think,

518
00:19:26,180 --> 00:19:27,300
"安迪一定超爱这个
"Oh, Andy would love that.

519
00:19:27,300 --> 00:19:28,200
真希望他也在这里
I wish he were here

520
00:19:28,200 --> 00:19:29,220
我就能跟他一起乐了"
so I could share it with him."

521
00:19:29,220 --> 00:19:29,460
但是
But...

522
00:19:30,740 --> 00:19:33,160
亲爱的 我知道我只是个机器人
Honey, I know I'm just a robot,

523
00:19:33,160 --> 00:19:35,140
但在我看来那就是爱啊
but that sounds like love to me.

524
00:19:42,009 --> 00:19:43,160
反正也无所谓了
Desn't matter anyway.

525
00:19:43,160 --> 00:19:44,720
他爱着别人
He's in love with someone else.

526
00:19:46,520 --> 00:19:47,940
或许我才是个疯子吧
Maybe I'm the crazy one.

527
00:19:51,820 --> 00:19:52,860
我不是故意要打扰的
Don't mean to interrupt.

528
00:19:53,009 --> 00:19:55,716
只是来道别一下
Just came to say goodbye.

529
00:19:56,318 --> 00:19:58,380
贝丝和我打算开车出去兜兜风
Beth and I are going to take a drive,

530
00:19:58,380 --> 00:19:59,840
欣赏夕阳的美景
try to catch the sunset.

531
00:20:00,551 --> 00:20:03,480
好的 祝你们玩得开心
Okay, well, have fun.

532
00:20:03,480 --> 00:20:04,140
好
Okay.

533
00:20:09,231 --> 00:20:11,245
是海莉 海莉就是那个女孩
It's Haley. Haley's the girl.

534
00:20:11,245 --> 00:20:12,816
你爱的是海...
You love Ha--

535
00:20:14,360 --> 00:20:15,360
你们爱着对方
love each other!

536
00:20:16,460 --> 00:20:18,420
走吧 我送你们出去
Come on. I'll walk you out.

537
00:20:19,960 --> 00:20:20,760
你们要去哪儿啊
Where are you going?

538
00:20:21,145 --> 00:20:22,782
你们爱着对方
You guys love each oth--

539
00:20:24,460 --> 00:20:26,960
你们正在犯下一个巨大的错误
You're making a huge mistake!

540
00:20:27,620 --> 00:20:28,980
准备好了吗
Ready?

541
00:20:31,580 --> 00:20:32,280
快回来
Come back.

542
00:20:36,860 --> 00:20:39,860
天啊 这下一定会很疼的
Oh, boy. This is gonna hurt.

543
00:20:42,097 --> 00:20:42,612
快停下
Stop!

544
00:20:45,280 --> 00:20:46,640
有人吗
Hello?

545
00:20:50,240 --> 00:20:51,260
有人吗
Hello?

546
00:20:52,140 --> 00:20:53,340
不要啊
No!

547
00:20:56,140 --> 00:20:56,700
有人吗
Hello?

548
00:20:58,440 --> 00:20:59,000
有人吗
Hello?

549
00:20:59,820 --> 00:21:01,260
有谁能听到我说话吗
Can anybody hear me?

550
00:21:03,080 --> 00:21:03,640
有人吗
Hello?

551
00:21:06,320 --> 00:21:07,340
谢天谢地
Oh, thank God.

552
00:21:07,421 --> 00:21:08,959
你一定得帮帮我 我出了点事故
You've got to help me. I've been in an accident.

553
00:21:08,959 --> 00:21:11,059
我需要你帮我找到我女儿
I-I need you to find my daughter.

554
00:21:12,200 --> 00:21:13,859
好极了 谢谢
Oh, great. Thank you.

555
00:21:13,859 --> 00:21:16,535
什么 你在干什么 你要去哪儿
What -- what are you doing? Where are you going?

556
00:21:16,680 --> 00:21:17,760
你要带我去哪儿
Where are you taking me?

557
00:21:17,800 --> 00:21:18,600
快把我放下
Put me down.

558
00:21:19,060 --> 00:21:20,540
救命啊 我被人劫持啦
Help! I'm being taken!
